---
id: no-unstable-deps
title: Disallow putting the result of query hooks directly in a React hook dependency array
---
NIFT_TANSTACK_DOCUMENT_V1
{"document":{"type":"root","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The object returned from the following query hooks is "},{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"not"}]},{"type":"text","value":" referentially stable:"}]},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"useQuery"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"useSuspenseQuery"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"useQueries"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"useSuspenseQueries"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"useInfiniteQuery"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"useSuspenseInfiniteQuery"}]}]},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"inlineCode","value":"useMutation"}]}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"The object returned from those hooks should "},{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"not"}]},{"type":"text","value":" be put directly into the dependency array of a React hook (e.g. "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"useEffect"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"useMemo"},{"type":"text","value":", "},{"type":"inlineCode","value":"useCallback"},{"type":"text","value":").\nInstead, destructure the return value of the query hook and pass the destructured values into the dependency array of the React hook."}]},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"rule-details","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Rule Details"}]},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Examples of "},{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"incorrect"}]},{"type":"text","value":" code for this rule:"}]},{"type":"code","value":"/* eslint \"@tanstack/query/no-unstable-deps\": \"warn\" */\nimport { useCallback } from 'react'\nimport { useMutation } from '@tanstack/react-query'\n\nfunction Component() {\n  const mutation = useMutation({ mutationFn: (value: string) => value })\n  const callback = useCallback(() => {\n    mutation.mutate('hello')\n  }, [mutation])\n  return null\n}","lang":"tsx"},{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Examples of "},{"type":"strong","children":[{"type":"text","value":"correct"}]},{"type":"text","value":" code for this rule:"}]},{"type":"code","value":"/* eslint \"@tanstack/query/no-unstable-deps\": \"warn\" */\nimport { useCallback } from 'react'\nimport { useMutation } from '@tanstack/react-query'\n\nfunction Component() {\n  const { mutate } = useMutation({ mutationFn: (value: string) => value })\n  const callback = useCallback(() => {\n    mutate('hello')\n  }, [mutate])\n  return null\n}","lang":"tsx"},{"type":"heading","depth":2,"id":"attributes","children":[{"type":"text","value":"Attributes"}]},{"type":"list","ordered":false,"items":[{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"✅ Recommended"}]}],"checked":true},{"type":"listItem","children":[{"type":"paragraph","children":[{"type":"text","value":"🔧 Fixable"}]}],"checked":false}]}],"headings":[{"id":"rule-details","text":"Rule Details","level":2},{"id":"attributes","text":"Attributes","level":2}]},"frameworks":[],"downloadMarkdown":"\nThe object returned from the following query hooks is **not** referentially stable:\n\n- `useQuery`\n- `useSuspenseQuery`\n- `useQueries`\n- `useSuspenseQueries`\n- `useInfiniteQuery`\n- `useSuspenseInfiniteQuery`\n- `useMutation`\n\nThe object returned from those hooks should **not** be put directly into the dependency array of a React hook (e.g. `useEffect`, `useMemo`, `useCallback`).\nInstead, destructure the return value of the query hook and pass the destructured values into the dependency array of the React hook.\n\n## Rule Details\n\nExamples of **incorrect** code for this rule:\n\n```tsx\n/* eslint \"@tanstack/query/no-unstable-deps\": \"warn\" */\nimport { useCallback } from 'react'\nimport { useMutation } from '@tanstack/react-query'\n\nfunction Component() {\n  const mutation = useMutation({ mutationFn: (value: string) => value })\n  const callback = useCallback(() => {\n    mutation.mutate('hello')\n  }, [mutation])\n  return null\n}\n```\n\nExamples of **correct** code for this rule:\n\n```tsx\n/* eslint \"@tanstack/query/no-unstable-deps\": \"warn\" */\nimport { useCallback } from 'react'\nimport { useMutation } from '@tanstack/react-query'\n\nfunction Component() {\n  const { mutate } = useMutation({ mutationFn: (value: string) => value })\n  const callback = useCallback(() => {\n    mutate('hello')\n  }, [mutate])\n  return null\n}\n```\n\n## Attributes\n\n- [x] ✅ Recommended\n- [ ] 🔧 Fixable\n","originalRawMarkdown":"---\nid: no-unstable-deps\ntitle: Disallow putting the result of query hooks directly in a React hook dependency array\n---\n\nThe object returned from the following query hooks is **not** referentially stable:\n\n- `useQuery`\n- `useSuspenseQuery`\n- `useQueries`\n- `useSuspenseQueries`\n- `useInfiniteQuery`\n- `useSuspenseInfiniteQuery`\n- `useMutation`\n\nThe object returned from those hooks should **not** be put directly into the dependency array of a React hook (e.g. `useEffect`, `useMemo`, `useCallback`).\nInstead, destructure the return value of the query hook and pass the destructured values into the dependency array of the React hook.\n\n## Rule Details\n\nExamples of **incorrect** code for this rule:\n\n```tsx\n/* eslint \"@tanstack/query/no-unstable-deps\": \"warn\" */\nimport { useCallback } from 'react'\nimport { useMutation } from '@tanstack/react-query'\n\nfunction Component() {\n  const mutation = useMutation({ mutationFn: (value: string) => value })\n  const callback = useCallback(() => {\n    mutation.mutate('hello')\n  }, [mutation])\n  return null\n}\n```\n\nExamples of **correct** code for this rule:\n\n```tsx\n/* eslint \"@tanstack/query/no-unstable-deps\": \"warn\" */\nimport { useCallback } from 'react'\nimport { useMutation } from '@tanstack/react-query'\n\nfunction Component() {\n  const { mutate } = useMutation({ mutationFn: (value: string) => value })\n  const callback = useCallback(() => {\n    mutate('hello')\n  }, [mutate])\n  return null\n}\n```\n\n## Attributes\n\n- [x] ✅ Recommended\n- [ ] 🔧 Fixable\n"}
